/td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Frame_Work\" title=\"Frame Work\">Frame Work</a></b>, End chests, <a href=\"/page/Dorris\" title=\"Dorris\">Dorris</a>' chests\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +6</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal +13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal +13</a>:</b> Passive: +13 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Heal_(skill)\" title=\"Heal (skill)\">Heal</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(enchantment)\" title=\"True Seeing (enchantment)\">True Seeing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(enchantment)\" title=\"True Seeing (enchantment)\">True Seeing</a>:</b> Passive: You gain the benefit of the spell <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(spell)\" title=\"True Seeing (spell)\">True Seeing</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\"> Reflex Save +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\"> Reflex Save +6</a>:</b> This item gives a +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to your Reflex saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Sora_Katra\" title=\"Cauldron of Sora Katra\">Battle-Scarred</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Sora_Katra\" title=\"Cauldron of Sora Katra\">Battle-Scarred</a>:</b> This item has obviously seen use in many fights. It is chipped and scratched, but perhaps in the future there will be a way to restore it to its former glory.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Wrath_of_Sora_Kell\" title=\"Named item sets\">Wrath of Sora Kell</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Wrath_of_Sora_Kell\" title=\"Named item sets\">Wrath of Sora Kell</a>:</b> 3 Pieces Equipped:<br />+20 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">Artifact bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a><br />+5 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">Artifact bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical Resistance Rating</a><br />+3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">Artifact bonus</a> to Hit and Damage<br />+1 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">Artifact bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Imbue_Dice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Imbue Dice\">Imbue Dice</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Head Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Head Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Teraza%27s_Sight.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Teraza%27s_Sight.png/420px-Teraza%27s_Sight.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"458\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Teraza%27s_Sight.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Battle-Scarred\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battle-Scarred\">Battle-Scarred</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Teraza%27s_Perfect_Sight\" title=\"Item:Teraza&#39;s Perfect Sight\">Teraza's Perfect Sight</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>A crown said to have been originally crafted for the hag queen Sora Teraza. It bestows its wearer with great wisdom, and the ability to see things as they truly are.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"backgro